{
  "id": "2KI.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Bakam 9",
  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu naaseeswaho amagita abe mukama wa Isirairi.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Erisa omurangi akeeta omu ha baana b'abarangi yamugambira ati: “Weteekanize, okwate ecupa y'amagita, ogende Ramosi-Giryadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu oraahikayo oserre Yehu mutabani wa Yehosafaati, Yehosafaati mwijukuru wa Namusi; otaahe omunju omuragire aruge omu bagenzi be, omutwale omu kisiika eky'omunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwate ecupa ey'amagita, ogamuseese ha mutwe noogamba oti: ‘MUKAMA naagamba ati, nakuseesaho amagita, obe mukama wa Isirairi.’ Hanyuma, okingule orwigi ogende; oteezigaziga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaija omuto omurangi yagenda Ramosi-Giryadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha yataahiire, engabwa z'ihe zikaba ziri omu rukurato; yagamba ati: “Waitu engabwa, nyina ebigambo ebi mbaleetiire.” Yehu yakaguza ati: “Omuli itwe, obireetiire oha?” Oli yagarukamu ati: “Mbireetiire iwe, waitu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 19:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababiri abo baataaha omunju; omusigazi yaseesa amagita ha mutwe gwa Yehu, naamugambira ati: “MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Isirairi naagamba ati: Nakuseesaho amagita, obe mukama oleme abantu ba MUKAMA, nubo Abaisirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oite enju y'Ahabbu mukama wawe, nukwo mpoole Yezebeeri enzigu habw'okwita abaheereza bange abarangi, n'abaheereza ba MUKAMA, abandi boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju y'Ahabbu yoona y'okuhwerekerra; ninyija kumumaraho abasaija boona, abanyagwa rundi abatali banyagwa omu Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju y'Ahabbu, ninyija kugikora nkooku nakozire eya Yerobbowamu mutabani wa Nebati, kandi nkooku nakozire eya Baasa mutabani w'Ahija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yezebeeri, embwa niziija kumuliira ha itaka lya Yezereeri, hatalibaho n'omu akumuziika.” Obu yamazire Kugamba ebi, yakingura orwigi yairuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu obu yahikireho abaheereza ba mukama we, baamukaguza bati; “Oku harungi? Omuntu omugu w'iraro onu kiki ekyamuleesire owaawe?” Yabagarukamu ati: “Omuntu ogu, mumumanyire, n'embaza ye nimugyetegereza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eki ogambire tikiri ky'amazima, Tugambire.” Yagamba ati: “Kinu nikyo yangambiire ati: ‘MUKAMA naagamba ati, nakuseesaho amagita, obe mukama wa Isirairi.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo boona baakwasire ebyokujwara byabo, baabimwalirra ha matembero eruguru arubateho, baateera engwara, baatokera haiguru bati: “Yehu nuwe mukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu naita Yoramu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu mutabani wa Yehosafaati, Yehosafaati mwijukuru wa Nimusi, nukwo yayekobere n'abandi ati okwemera Yoramu. (Yoramu n'Abaisirairi boona, bakaba nibalinda omu kiikaro Giryadi, barwanise Hazayeri omukama wa Siriya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu omukama Yoramu, akaba agarukire Yezereeri kutambirwa ebihuta, ebi yahutaaziibwe Abasiriya, naarwana na Hazayeri omukama wa Siriya.) Yehu akagamba ati: “Kinu obu oraaba nikyo orukuteekereza, otaikiriza omuntu n'omu kuruga omu rubuga, akagenda kutwara amakuru ago Yezereeri;” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yehu yatembere ekigaali kye, yagenda Yezereeri; habwokuba Yoramu nuho akaba ali. Kandi Ahaziya omukama wa Yuda, akaba abungiire Yoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, omu munaara ogwa Yezereeri, hakaba heemeriireyo omulinzi, yaleeba Yehu n'abantu be nibaija, yagamba ati: “Nindora ekitebe ky'abantu.” Yoramu yagamba ati: “Kwata omutembi w'embaraasi omu, omutume agende abaitirane, abakaguze ati: ‘Muleesirwe birungi?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaija omutembi w'embaraasi yagenda, kwitirana Yehu, yamugambira ati: “Omukama naakukaguza ngu oleesirwe birungi?” Yehu yakaguza ati: “Eby'obusinge, iwe obiroho ki? Kubuutuka ongaruke enyuma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukwenda ondi akatumwa owa Yehu, yamukaguza ekikaguzo nkakiri omurundi gundi Yehu yamugarukamu ati: “Eki okifiireho ki? Garuka enyuma yange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulinzi yagaruka obwa kabiri naaranga ati: “Omukwenda abahikireho, baitu tali w'okugaruka.” Yayongera yagamba ati: “Omwebembezi w'abantu bali ekigaali kye naakiirukya nk'omugu w'iraro, nka Yehu wonyini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoramu yagamba ati: “Munteekanirize ekigaali.” Baakimuteekaniriza. Hanyuma Yoramu omukama wa Isirairi, n'Ahaziya omukama wa Yuda, baimukya, buli omu ali omu kigaali kye, baagenda kwitirana Yehu, baamusanga ha musiri gwa Nabosi Omuyezereeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoramu obu yaboine Yehu, yakaguza ati: “Yehu, oleesirwe birungi?” Oli yagarukamu ati: “Obusiihani bwa nyoko Yezebeeri n'oburogo bwe obu biraaba nibikyayeyongera, kandi obusinge buraaruga ha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yoramu yahindwire embaraasi ye, yairuka yagambira Ahaziya ati: “Ahaziya, ofuuhye obugobya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu yaleega obuta bwe n'amaani ge goona, yarasa Yoramu emitumanyima, omusogi gwakwata n'omutima, yagwa omu kigaali kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu akagambira Bidukaari engabwa ye ati: “Muhimbe omunage omu musiri gwa Nabosi Omuyezereeri; habwokuba oijuke, iwe na nyowe obu tukaba tutembere embaraasi, iwe oli ha rubaju rumu, nyowe ndi ha rundi, tukuraatiire Ahabbu ise, MUKAMA nkooku yamugambireho ebigambo ebi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 21:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: ‘Mazimakwo, ijo nkooku naboine esagama ya Nabosi n'eya batabani be, na iwe nukwo ndukwija kukukora ekikusemeriire omu musiri gunu gwonyini.’ Habweki hati, mutwale omunage omu musiri gwa Nabosi, MUKAMA nkooku yagambire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu naita Ahaziya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya omukama wa Yuda obu yaboine eki yasingirwa ha bukiizi bwa Besi-hagani. Yehu yamugwa omu kirale yagamba ati: “Na uwe murase”; baamurasa naavuga ekigaali kye, ha matemba ga Guuli enyakuherraine na Ibulyamu. Yairukira Megido, oku nuho yagwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheereza be baamutwarra omu kigaali, baamuhikya Yerusaalemu, baamuziike omu kituuro hamu na baisenkuru omu rubuga rwa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa ikumi na gumu ogwa Yoramu mutabani w'Ahabbu, nugwo Ahaziya yateeriiremu engoma ya Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okufa kwa Yezebeeri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu obu yahikireho Yezereeri, Yezebeeri yakimanya; yayekunisa ha maiso yayetiibiibya omutwe, yalinguliririza omu idirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu obwakaba naataaha omu irembo, Yezebeeri yakaguza ati: “Iwe Zimuli kiita mukama wawe, olesirwe birungi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu yaimukya amaiso, yarorra omu idirisa yakaguza ati: “N'oha ogu anyakuli ha rubaju rwange? N'oha?” Abakonwa babiri rundi basatu baamuhanga amaiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabagambira ati: “Omukazi mumusindike agwe hansi.” Baamusindika yagwa; esagama ye yataraakira ekisiika n'embaraasi, Yehu yatemba embaraasi ze n'ekigaali kye, yamurubaatirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yagenda yalya kandi yanywa; yagamba ati: “Hati, mukoleho omukazi ogu omukyenwa, mumuziike; habwokuba mubiitokati.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu baagenzire kumuziika, batamusange weena ahikiriire, bakasangaho oruhanga, ebigere n'ebiganja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baagarukire baagambira Yehu, akagamba ati: “Eki nikyo MUKAMA yagambire, eki yagambiire omu muheereza we Eriya Omutiisubi ati: ‘Omu kibanja kya Yezereeri, embwa nuho ziririirra omutumbi gwa Yezebeeri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutumbi gwa Yezebeeri nigwija kuba nk'obusa obunyakunaganagirwe omu musiri omu kibanja kya Yezereeri, nukwo habuleho n'omu ow'aligamba ati: Ogu nuwe ayali Yezebeeri.’ ” “Agobeza munywani we azimba enda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
